  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Monitor Job Status\n",
    "\n",
    "After launching the pruning jobs, we need to monitor their progress. SageMaker Processing jobs run asynchronously, so we'll periodically check their status until all jobs are complete.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Monitoring Process:\n",
    "1. **Create a SageMaker client** to interact with the SageMaker API\n",
    "2. **Check job status every 30 seconds** until all jobs are complete\n",
    "3. **Display a status table** showing the current status of each job\n",
    "\n",
    "Pruning is generally faster than training but can still take several minutes depending on the model size and instance type. The status table will update automatically to show the progress of each job."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Monitor job status\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Get the SageMaker client\n",
    "sagemaker_client = boto3.client(\"sagemaker\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Initialize status tracking\n",
    "job_statuses = {model_key: \"Starting\" for model_key in pruning_jobs.keys()}\n",
    "start_time = time.time()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Monitor all jobs until they complete\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    while \"InProgress\" in job_statuses.values() or \"Starting\" in job_statuses.values():\n",
    "        # Check status of all jobs\n",
    "        for model_key, job in pruning_jobs.items():\n",
    "            if job_statuses[model_key] not in [\"Completed\", \"Failed\", \"Stopped\"]:\n",
    "                response = sagemaker_client.describe_processing_job(\n",
    "                    ProcessingJobName=job.job_name\n",
    "                )\n",
    "                job_statuses[model_key] = response[\"ProcessingJobStatus\"]\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Calculate elapsed time\n",
    "        elapsed_time = time.time() - start_time\n",
    "        elapsed_minutes = int(elapsed_time // 60)\n",
    "        elapsed_seconds = int(elapsed_time % 60)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Clear previous output and display current status\n",
    "        clear_output(wait=True)\n",
    "        print(f\"Elapsed Time: {elapsed_minutes:02d}:{elapsed_seconds:02d}\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Create a status table\n",
    "        status_data = []\n",
    "        for model_key, status in job_statuses.items():\n",
    "            status_data.append({\n",
    "                \"Model\": model_key,\n",
    "                \"Status\": status,\n",
    "                \"Job Name\": pruning_jobs[model_key].job_name\n",
    "            })\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Display status table\n",
    "        status_df = pd.DataFrame(status_data)\n",
    "        display(status_df)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # If jobs are still running, wait before checking again\n",
    "        if \"InProgress\" in job_statuses.values() or \"Starting\" in job_statuses.values():\n",
    "            print(\"Waiting for jobs to complete...\")\n",
    "            time.sleep(30)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Final status summary\n",
    "    print(\"Final Job Status Summary:\")\n",
    "    for model_key, status in job_statuses.items():\n",
    "        if status == \"Completed\":\n",
    "            print(f\"\u2705 {model_key}: Job completed successfully\")\n",
    "        elif status == \"Failed\":\n",
    "            print(f\"\u274c {model_key}: Job failed\")\n",
    "            # Use our utility function to analyze the failure\n",
    "            analyze_job_failure(pruning_jobs[model_key].job_name)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            print(f\"\u26a0\ufe0f {model_key}: Job ended with status: {status}\")\n",
    "            \n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print(f\"Error monitoring jobs: {e}\")\n",
    "    # Use our utility function to handle the error\n",
    "    for model_key, job in pruning_jobs.items():\n",
    "        if job_statuses[model_key] not in [\"Completed\", \"Failed\", \"Stopped\"]:\n",
    "            handle_processing_error(e, job.job_name)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
